.TH ULTIMATE-VOCAL-REMOVER 1 "July 2026" "Ultimate Vocal Remover 5.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ultimate-vocal-remover, uvr \- separate vocals and instruments from audio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ultimate-vocal-remover
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Ultimate Vocal Remover
is a graphical application that uses neural network models to separate vocals
and instruments from audio files. This package provides a community-maintained,
CPU-only Linux build.
.PP
Models and application data are stored below
.IR ~/.local/share/ultimate-vocal-remover ,
settings below
.IR ~/.config/ultimate-vocal-remover ,
and caches below
.IR ~/.cache/ultimate-vocal-remover .
The corresponding XDG environment variables override these base directories.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B ultimate-vocal-remover
Start the graphical interface.
.TP
.B uvr
Short alias for
.BR ultimate-vocal-remover .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/ultimate-vocal-remover.desktop
Desktop menu entry.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/ultimate-vocal-remover/README.md
Project documentation, original credits, and usage information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR rubberband (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Ultimate Vocal Remover was created by Anjok07 and Aufr33. This Linux package is
a community-maintained, unofficial distribution.
